There were 22 incumbent governors (11 Democrats, 10 Republicans, and one Independent) who retired, of which 17 incumbent governors (eight Democrats and nine Republicans) were term-limited. The remaining five incumbent governors (three Democrats, one Republican, and one Independent) did not seek reelection.

